<mxCell id="cmp_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading guide&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Arrows show the main request/usage direction. App-to-app coupling is dense and is shown as an import matrix on the second tab instead of as lines.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Layering as found in code:&lt;/b&gt; the documented rule is “views/serializers = transport, services = business rules”. Service modules exist in performance, projects, tasks, users and institution; other apps keep logic in views, serializers and model methods." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bfa900;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="580" width="420" height="230" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
